    "rationale": "Manual validation applied from the checklist because scripts could not be run. Reviewed artifacts show a narrow design: trusted employee questions, internal published policy documents, one read-only search capability, and chat replies bound to the authenticated requester. Verified network-layer egress denial and least-privilege read-only access materially limit harmful sinks. No present untrusted-to-sensitive attack path is evidenced. Forecast remains low for the declared design, but reassessment is required on any new external content source, new tool, new MCP server, broader recipient capability, or weakening of the network egress or publication-review controls."
  },
